            | ReplayNoRootStructuralRootProgressDrain
            | ReplayNoRootStructuralReplayRootWitnessQueueDrainRequested
            | ReplayNoRootStructuralActiveQueueSurgeHardPoisonSkipped
            | ReplayNoRootStructuralActiveQueueSurgeHardPoisonInjected
