            | TerminalFlowQueueRecoveryHeldByFairness of TerminalFlowFairnessCredentialHold
            | TerminalFlowQueueRecoveryReadyForReducerSeal of TerminalFlowQueueRecoveryCertificate
            | TerminalFlowQueueRecoveryRejectedByProgressRegression of TerminalFlowProgressRegression

        type TerminalFlowLegacyAuthorityEraseReceipt = private {
