            | TerminalFlowDispatchProtocolIssuedObserved of issuanceRef:uint32 * constitutionRef:uint32 * lineageRef:uint32 * rootRef:uint32 * terminalRef:uint32 * fillRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowDispatchProtocolNonDispatchObserved of TerminalFlowDispatchProtocolState

