            | TerminalFlowActorSchedulerFillMismatch of schedulerFillRef:uint32 * requestFillRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowActorKernelDispatchRequestMismatch of dispatchRequestRef:uint32 * requestRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowActorKernelDispatchFillMismatch of dispatchFillRef:uint32 * requestFillRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowActorPossessionTerminalMismatch of possessionTerminalRef:uint32 * requestTerminalRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowActorPossessionFillMismatch of possessionFillRef:uint32 * requestFillRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowActorProtocolLineageMismatch of protocolLineageRef:uint32 * requestLineageRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowActorProtocolRootMismatch of protocolRootRef:uint32 * requestRootRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowActorProtocolTerminalMismatch of protocolTerminalRef:uint32 * requestTerminalRef:uint32
            | TerminalFlowActorProtocolFillMismatch of protocolFillRef:uint32 * requestFillRef:uint32
